OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry and bright with
OL,6,Fsunny spells and feeling warm in the
OL,7,Fsunshine. Isolated showers possible in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, mainly over the hills.
OL,9,FLight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry for most with the cloud
OL,12,Foften well broken, clear skies at
OL,13,Ftimes. However, a little patchy rain
OL,14,Fcould push through Lochaber and the
OL,15,FUists later in the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,18,Fwith hazy sunshine. Cloudier skies at
OL,19,Ftimes across Caithness with showery
OL,20,Fbursts of rain possible through
OL,21,FLochaber, Skye and the Uists.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
